# --- Personal data: NEVER commit -------------------------------------------
# Input zips, generated subscriber lists, logs and reports contain real
# email addresses. Tests build their fixtures in code, so no data files
# belong in this repo at all.
*.zip
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xls
*.ods
*.docx
*.pdf
*.log
*.txt
!requirements*.txt

